<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/b34d47f6d8d7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Gayle King of CBS News posted a warning to Instagram on Monday, sharing a snippet of a video that used her likeness for a purported weight loss product." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3183" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/c3e8a103bfa3> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[3182] Gayle King has hit out at an AI generated advert that manipulated a video of her to advertise its weight loss services. [3183] YouTube star MrBeast, whose real name is Jimmy Donaldson, shared an AI-generated video of himself Sunday. [3181] A day earlier, actor Tom Hanks warned that someone used the technology to create a video of him touting the benefits of a dental plan." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3182" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/d81369049be7> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "I posted this video promoting my radio show on August 31 (swipe to see the original), and they’ve manipulated my voice and video to make it seem like I’m promoting it." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3182" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e347f6e975cc> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Gayle King slams AI advert that uses manipulated video of her" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3182" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/e3a3181b7915> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The post, apparently from a company named Artipet, uses King's likeness and voice to try and sell weight loss products." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3182" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/efe94afe9e6c> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The audio either splices together actual words and phrases from many hours of source footage, or generates realistic impersonations of the voice from the same training data." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "3184" .

